Subject: [PATCH] qtdemux: preserve early adaptive stream titles

Keep a supplied stream title that arrives before moov exposes source pads.
Use it only for single-track, time-driven fragmented input, and never
override an in-band title. Clear it on new streams and hard resets.
No extra manifest requests, decoder changes or track-index mapping.

Upstream-Status: Pending
AI-Generated: OpenAI Codex
